    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got back from a massive flight from singapore to london like 14 hours in the air... i feel super wiped and my breathing is kinda weird like a bit shallow and heavy, plus my left calf is actually really sore and feels tight. is this just like intense jet lag or am i just dehydrated from the flight?",
